#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Cloudflare Email Routing becomes the MX of your domain and receives the mail. Yuva does not listen for SMTP, so there is no mail server to install or keep patched."
msgstr "Cloudflare Email Routing passa a ser l'MX del vostre domini i rep el correu. Yuva no escolta SMTP, així que no cal instal·lar ni mantenir cap servidor de correu."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Cloudflare Email Routing receives the message and passes it to the Yuva Email Worker."
msgstr "Cloudflare Email Routing rep el missatge i el passa al Yuva Email Worker."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Cloudflare, the Cloudflare logo and Cloudflare Workers are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Cloudflare, Inc. in the United States and other jurisdictions. Yuva is an independent open-source project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Cloudflare."
msgstr "Cloudflare, el logotip de Cloudflare i Cloudflare Workers són marques comercials i/o marques comercials registrades de Cloudflare, Inc. als Estats Units i en altres jurisdiccions. Yuva és un projecte independent de codi obert, no afiliat a Cloudflare ni avalat per ella."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Cloudflare® Email Routing receives the mail for your support addresses, and the open-source Yuva Email Worker hands each message to Yuva, signed. It lands in your shared inbox as a conversation your team answers."
msgstr "Cloudflare® Email Routing rep el correu de les vostres adreces de suport, i el Yuva Email Worker de codi obert lliura cada missatge a Yuva, signat. Arriba a la vostra safata compartida com una conversa que respon el vostre equip."

