msgstr "Yuva Email Worker per a Cloudflare"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Yuva finds the e-mail channel for the recipient address and threads the message by In-Reply-To and References into the conversation it belongs to. Anything else starts a new conversation. A reply reopens the conversation."
msgstr "Yuva troba el canal de correu de l'adreça destinatària i enfila el missatge amb In-Reply-To i References a la conversa a la qual pertany. Qualsevol altra cosa comença una conversa nova. Una resposta reobre la conversa."

